@startuml UcResendVerification

title Authentication — ResendVerificationUseCase

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

' ── Ports OUT ─────────────────────────────────
interface "LoadUserPort"    as LOAD  #A5D6A7
interface "SaveUserPort"    as SAVE  #A5D6A7
interface "EmailSenderPort" as EMAIL #A5D6A7

component [UserAggregate]   as UA    #FFF9C4

' ══ ResendVerificationUseCase ════════════════
package "ResendVerificationUseCase" #E3F2FD {
    interface "ResendVerificationPort" as P_RES
    component [ResendVerificationUseCase] as UC_RES
    P_RES ..|> UC_RES
}

UC_RES --> LOAD  : findById(userId)
UC_RES --> UA    : regenera VerificationToken
UC_RES --> SAVE  : save(user)
UC_RES --> EMAIL : sendEmail(to, subject, body)

note right of LOAD
  CQRS — command side.
  Devuelve UserAggregate para
  poder regenerar el token de
  verificación y persistirlo.
end note

note right of EMAIL
  EmailSenderPort:
  · SmtpEmailSenderAdapter si spring.mail.host está configurado
  · NoOpEmailSenderAdapter como fallback (logs WARN)
end note

note right of UA
  Si emailVerified = true →
  EmailAlreadyVerifiedException
end note

@enduml

